---
import LocalTime from "../LocalTime.astro";
import GitHubCalendar from "./react/GitHubCalendar";
---

<section id="about" class="section">
  <div class="container container--section">
    <h2>About me</h2>

    <p class="about__p">
      Hello, I'm Alexander Gabriel Ho. I'm a web developer who enjoys building
      things for the web and figuring out how they work. I focus on the small
      details that make a website polished, easy to use, and nice to look at.
    </p>
    <p class="about__p">
      Most of my work is on web applications, where I focus on clean structure
      and code that's easy to maintain. I like to keep things simple and clear,
      so both users and other developers can understand and use them easily.
    </p>
    <p class="about__p">
      I began learning programming in 2021. Initially, I was uncertain about
      what to study and how to proceed, but this confusion developed into a
      curiosity about the learning process. This curiosity led me to explore web
      development and continues to influence how I approach projects.
    </p>
    <p class="about__p">
      Over time, my interest evolved into building platforms that enable people
      to express themselves freely online. I am especially committed to creating
      accessible projects that promote openness, community, and honest
      expression.
    </p>
    <p class="about__p">
      At the end of the day, I really enjoy seeing how people use the stuff I
      build and finding little ways to make those experiences feel natural and
      enjoyable. For me, coding's just as much about experimenting and learning
      as it is about building, and I'm always looking for new ways to do both.
    </p>

    <div class="about__extra">
      <LocalTime />

      <div class="github-calendar-card">
        <p class="github-calendar-card__label">GitHub contributions</p>

        <GitHubCalendar client:only="react" username="alexndrho" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <style>
    .about__p {
      font-weight: 500;
      text-align: justify;
    }

    .about__extra {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: var(--spacing-md);
    }

    .github-calendar-card {
      min-width: 0;
      max-width: 100%;
      padding: var(--spacing-md);
      border-radius: var(--border-radius-md);
      box-shadow: var(--box-shadow);
    }

    .github-calendar-card__label {
      margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
      font-size: var(--font-size-md);
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    @media (--lg-viewport) {
      .about__extra {
        flex-direction: row;
        align-items: start;
      }
    }
  </style>
</section>
